        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quess</strong> is a bold reimagining of three classic board games — <strong>Chess, Checkers, and Backgammon</strong> — redesigned for <strong>4-player strategic battles</strong> in a cosmic elemental universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with friends across <strong>PC, mobile, and iPad</strong>, create <strong>private multiplayer rooms</strong>, and share a simple room code to start matches instantly. Whether you're competing with friends or challenging AI opponents, Quess delivers a fresh multiplayer twist on timeless strategy games.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962760/extras/2acf43835e816a62dd03399d41cae4ea.avif?t=1773663639\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962760/extras_big/2acf43835e816a62dd03399d41cae4ea.avif?t=1773663639 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in a stylized cosmic realm where ancient elemental beings fight for control of reality, Quess invites you to join their eternal contest. Choose your element — <strong>Earth, Fire, Water, or Air</strong> — and enter the arena to outsmart, outmaneuver, and outplay your rivals.<br><br>Compete across beautifully animated <strong>3D boards</strong>, customize your chess pieces (Traditional, Chinese, or French styles), and unlock visual effects that represent your chosen element.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962760/extras/1f6c557c557c9ee95370623386a47ad9.avif?t=1773663639\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962760/extras_big/1f6c557c557c9ee95370623386a47ad9.avif?t=1773663639 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >✨ Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧩 <strong>Three Classic Games — Reimagined for 4 Players</strong><br>Experience strategic 4-player versions of Chess, Checkers, and Backgammon in one unified game universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌐 <strong>Cross-Platform Multiplayer</strong><br>Play together across <strong>PC, mobile, and tablet devices</strong> with seamless online multiplayer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔑 <strong>Private Room Matches</strong><br>Create a room, share a code, and instantly play with <strong>friends or family anywhere in the world</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧠 <strong>Challenge Advanced AI</strong><br>Practice your strategy by competing against smart AI-controlled opponents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌍 <strong>Elemental Identity</strong><br>Choose Earth, Fire, Water, or Air — each element changes the visual identity of your pieces and throne.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎨 <strong>Stylized 3D Boards &amp; Effects</strong><br>Enjoy richly designed environments, dynamic VFX, and immersive cosmic visuals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧙 <strong>Lore-Driven Intro Cinematic</strong><br>Discover the mythic backstory of Quess through a cinematic introduction that sets the stage for the elemental conflict.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962760/extras/0b2c9db2a564f3fbed6ef50a077520a4.poster.avif?t=1773663639\" width=450 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962760/extras/0b2c9db2a564f3fbed6ef50a077520a4.webm?t=1773663639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962760/extras/0b2c9db2a564f3fbed6ef50a077520a4.mp4?t=1773663639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a board game veteran or a newcomer seeking a new strategic challenge, <strong>Quess</strong> offers a competitive and modern take on timeless classics — now expanded into a <strong>4-player elemental battlefield</strong>.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quess</strong> is a bold reimagining of three classic board games — <strong>Chess, Checkers, and Backgammon</strong> — redesigned for <strong>4-player strategic battles</strong> in a cosmic elemental universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with friends across <strong>PC, mobile, and iPad</strong>, create <strong>private multiplayer rooms</strong>, and share a simple room code to start matches instantly. Whether you're competing with friends or challenging AI opponents, Quess delivers a fresh multiplayer twist on timeless strategy games.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962760/extras/2acf43835e816a62dd03399d41cae4ea.avif?t=1773663639\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962760/extras_big/2acf43835e816a62dd03399d41cae4ea.avif?t=1773663639 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in a stylized cosmic realm where ancient elemental beings fight for control of reality, Quess invites you to join their eternal contest. Choose your element — <strong>Earth, Fire, Water, or Air</strong> — and enter the arena to outsmart, outmaneuver, and outplay your rivals.<br><br>Compete across beautifully animated <strong>3D boards</strong>, customize your chess pieces (Traditional, Chinese, or French styles), and unlock visual effects that represent your chosen element.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962760/extras/1f6c557c557c9ee95370623386a47ad9.avif?t=1773663639\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962760/extras_big/1f6c557c557c9ee95370623386a47ad9.avif?t=1773663639 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >✨ Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧩 <strong>Three Classic Games — Reimagined for 4 Players</strong><br>Experience strategic 4-player versions of Chess, Checkers, and Backgammon in one unified game universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌐 <strong>Cross-Platform Multiplayer</strong><br>Play together across <strong>PC, mobile, and tablet devices</strong> with seamless online multiplayer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔑 <strong>Private Room Matches</strong><br>Create a room, share a code, and instantly play with <strong>friends or family anywhere in the world</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧠 <strong>Challenge Advanced AI</strong><br>Practice your strategy by competing against smart AI-controlled opponents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌍 <strong>Elemental Identity</strong><br>Choose Earth, Fire, Water, or Air — each element changes the visual identity of your pieces and throne.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎨 <strong>Stylized 3D Boards &amp; Effects</strong><br>Enjoy richly designed environments, dynamic VFX, and immersive cosmic visuals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧙 <strong>Lore-Driven Intro Cinematic</strong><br>Discover the mythic backstory of Quess through a cinematic introduction that sets the stage for the elemental conflict.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962760/extras/0b2c9db2a564f3fbed6ef50a077520a4.poster.avif?t=1773663639\" width=450 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962760/extras/0b2c9db2a564f3fbed6ef50a077520a4.webm?t=1773663639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962760/extras/0b2c9db2a564f3fbed6ef50a077520a4.mp4?t=1773663639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a board game veteran or a newcomer seeking a new strategic challenge, <strong>Quess</strong> offers a competitive and modern take on timeless classics — now expanded into a <strong>4-player elemental battlefield</strong>.</p>",
